url: "https://github.com/DavidSinger85/MarkerFlow"
keywords:
  - metabarcoding
  - amplicon
  - DADA2
  - ASV
  - 18S
  - ITS
  - 16S
  - bioinformatics
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21891535"

